<div class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Our Programmes</h1>
    <p>Two-year intermediate programmes affiliated with TSBIE — MPC and BiPC</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="container section">
  <div class="grid-2">

    <div class="program-card">
      <div class="program-code">MPC</div>
      <div class="program-name">Mathematics · Physics · Chemistry</div>
      <p>For students aiming for IIT-JEE Main &amp; Advanced, JEE Main + EAPCET (Engineering), B.Sc. Mathematics, or Computer Science. Strong emphasis on problem-solving and analytical thinking.</p>
      <ul class="subject-list">
        <li>Mathematics</li>
        <li>Physics</li>
        <li>Chemistry</li>
        <li>English (Compulsory)</li>
        <li>Second Language (Telugu / Hindi)</li>
      </ul>
      <a href="/admissions" class="btn btn-primary">Apply for MPC</a>
    </div>

    <div class="program-card">
      <div class="program-code">BiPC</div>
      <div class="program-name">Biology · Physics · Chemistry</div>
      <p>For students aiming for NEET UG (MBBS / BDS), EAPCET (Medical / Pharmacy), B.Sc. Biology, or Allied Health Sciences. Intensive coverage of Botany, Zoology, and Applied Sciences.</p>
      <ul class="subject-list">
        <li>Biology (Botany + Zoology)</li>
        <li>Physics</li>
        <li>Chemistry</li>
        <li>English (Compulsory)</li>
        <li>Second Language (Telugu / Hindi)</li>
      </ul>
      <a href="/admissions" class="btn btn-primary">Apply for BiPC</a>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="info-box mt-3">
    <h4>Scholarship on Admission</h4>
    <ul>
      <li>Up to 90% tuition fee waiver based on our scholarship test score.</li>
      <li>Government scholarships (SC/ST, BC, EBC, NTR Vidyonnathi) are also facilitated through the college.</li>
      <li><a href="/scholarship/apply">Apply for scholarship →</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

